00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:44.460
Math...

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:47.100
"An impossibly huge castle of rock and iron,

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:51.440
floating in an endless expanse of sky. That is the entirety of this world.

